@format 1
@id project.delete-scene
@title Delete named scene
@area Project
@entry input
@summary Confirm and remove one named scene from the persistent scene collection.
@flow TB
@related project.save-scene

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias scene = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScene

[input] Scene delete requested <input>
- Receive the close command for a named scene row @ console.PConsoleSceneClose(...)
> confirm

[confirm] Confirm deletion <decision>
- Ask the user to confirm removal @ console.PConsoleSceneClose(...)
? "User declines" > unchanged
? "User confirms" > remove

[remove] Delete scene <storage>
- Remove the named scene and persist the collection @ scene.LSceneDelete(...)
- Rebuild the scene list @ console.PConsoleSceneRebuild(...)
> result

[result] Scene deleted <output>
= The named scene is no longer available.

[unchanged] Scene retained <output>
= Persistent scene state is unchanged.
